{"4386460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Not Done Yet", "steam_appid": 4386460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow 2 prototype toys in this local 2 player 3D puzzle-adventure game looking to find new life for their fellow abandoned toys for their story is <strong>Not Done Yet</strong>!<br><br><strong>- Meet the Dream Team!</strong><br>Through hopes and prayers of the abandoned factory toys, the prototypes Hoppie and Saddie finds new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/39a6ea5c1003941e992d40fb29d2439f.poster.avif?t=1781358518\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/39a6ea5c1003941e992d40fb29d2439f.webm?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/39a6ea5c1003941e992d40fb29d2439f.mp4?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>They find themselves at odds against the boss Knitty! Who have taken over the factory with her minions. They stole half of the toy promotional poster that was supposed to be pinned at the city's largest toy store! With the aid of Cheesy, the wise old mouse, the two of them will have to retrieve the other half to piece the poster back in one piece and escape the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/ac493e8fa0c69f9c8038779ec8ce13c9.poster.avif?t=1781358518\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/ac493e8fa0c69f9c8038779ec8ce13c9.webm?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/ac493e8fa0c69f9c8038779ec8ce13c9.mp4?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>- It Takes Two to Make It Work!</strong><br><br>Navigate the factory through obstacles and Knitty's minions. Saddie is able to navigate tight spaces while Hoppie is able to fit through shorter gaps and provide a little height boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/8c652eb1a3b427eb98bf9850276388b8.poster.avif?t=1781358518\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/8c652eb1a3b427eb98bf9850276388b8.webm?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/8c652eb1a3b427eb98bf9850276388b8.mp4?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/64b60d7ebe3a367449fb521d3340c953.poster.avif?t=1781358518\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/64b60d7ebe3a367449fb521d3340c953.webm?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/64b60d7ebe3a367449fb521d3340c953.mp4?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Snap and Click!</strong><br><br>Make use of scattered blocks or even create your own around the factory to get over ledges and hard to reach places!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/075d50e23441a72814e27bc5dbab6c59.poster.avif?t=1781358518\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/075d50e23441a72814e27bc5dbab6c59.webm?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/075d50e23441a72814e27bc5dbab6c59.mp4?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/9c56e1aaa54c15dd2c80ca0e120a6718.poster.avif?t=1781358518\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/9c56e1aaa54c15dd2c80ca0e120a6718.webm?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/9c56e1aaa54c15dd2c80ca0e120a6718.mp4?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Who Left These Around?</strong><br><br>Matchsticks are found around the factory that the duo are able to utilise to burn webs and distract Knitty's pesky minions to give yourself a chance of escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/5119627d1ed7576f3bdb5275464eac38.poster.avif?t=1781358518\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386460/extras/5119627d1ed7576f3bdb5275464eac38.webm?t=1781358518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/43